WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.180
In 1987, Christians began
marching through city streets,

2
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:06.010
singing worship songs.

3
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.920
One of its founders, Graham Kendrick, writes
songs found in Catholic and Protestant

4
00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:12.160
hymn books.

5
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:16.950
In America, a youth pastor started a
rock band with students from his church:

6
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.560
Casting Crowns.

7
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:21.900
Guitars, drums, words on a screen.

8
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:25.970
So can a song like that be
as holy as an ancient chant?

9
00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:30.080
In this mission, you'll find out what
makes worship music contemporary,

10
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.750
and where it is used.

11
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.060
Then you'll weigh up the debates, as
some Christians welcome it and others are

12
00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:37.260
cautious.

13
00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:42.200
Your mission: decide whether a guitar
worship song can be as holy as an ancient

14
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:42.920
chant.
